WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.281 --> 00:00:01.301
Age.

00:00:01.922 --> 00:00:03.370
It’s more than just a number.

00:00:04.477 --> 00:00:05.706
It’s a state of being.

00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:08.976
It’s a mindset.

00:00:10.383 --> 00:00:11.612
It’s part of your story.

00:00:13.004 --> 00:00:15.382
But it’s not necessarily a
reflection of your health.

00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:18.685
That’s why knowing your
Vitality AgeTM is so important.

00:00:19.444 --> 00:00:22.387
Vitality Age is a simple
measure of your current health

00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:26.957
based on your physical condition
and lifestyle choices like eating,

00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:29.897
sleeping and being
active, to name a few.

00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:33.308
Put it this way: when
you live a healthy life,

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.236
you may be younger than the number
of candles on your birthday cake.

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:39.673
But the reverse is also true,
depending on your overall health.

00:00:40.512 --> 00:00:44.754
Knowing your Vitality Age is the best way
to find out how healthy you are right now,

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:48.949
and to help to set goals to further
improve your health, little by little.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.519
And you don’t have to be a Manulife
Vitality member to learn yours.

00:00:52.857 --> 00:00:56.456
Find out how healthy you are
today at Manulife.ca/Vitality

